<title>USA: Lucent wins Thailand contract.</title>
<headline>Lucent wins Thailand contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it won a multi-million dollar contract from Total Access Communication (Public) Co Ltd to install a code division multiple access (CDMA) wireless system.</p>
<p>Lucent will supply its 5ESS-2000 switching system and other equipment to support 69 cellsites capable of handling up to 150,000 subscribers.  -- New York Newsroom 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
